{"mode":"words","text":"Zgoraj vidiš besedilo točno tako, kot ti ga prikaže aplikacija. Vsaka beseda je majhna kartica: zgoraj je beseda v ciljnem jeziku, pod njo pa njen pomen v tvojem maternem jeziku – beseda za besedo, v vrstnem redu ciljnega jezika. Pod tem je še enkrat naveden celoten stavek, tekoče preveden. Pri jezikih z drugačnim pisom je dodana vrstica s transkripcijo, da lahko vse prebereš. Dotakni se besede: glas bo nadaljeval predvajanje točno od tam.","words":[{"s":0,"e":400},{"s":440,"e":640},{"s":700,"e":1200},{"s":1253,"e":1600},{"s":1680,"e":2240},{"s":2280,"e":2400},{"s":2427,"e":2480},{"s":2533,"e":2640},{"s":2680,"e":3120},{"s":3160,"e":4000},{"s":4213,"e":4880},{"s":4960,"e":5440},{"s":5573,"e":5840},{"s":5880,"e":6240},{"s":6304,"e":6960},{"s":7400,"e":8160},{"s":8187,"e":8240},{"s":8280,"e":8640},{"s":8680,"e":8720},{"s":8760,"e":9040},{"s":9093,"e":10080},{"s":10140,"e":10320},{"s":10360,"e":10480},{"s":10560,"e":10720},{"s":10760,"e":10880},{"s":10960,"e":11360},{"s":11440,"e":11520},{"s":11560,"e":11840},{"s":11920,"e":12480},{"s":12533,"e":13040},{"s":13320,"e":13600},{"s":13660,"e":14080},{"s":14133,"e":14240},{"s":14300,"e":14800},{"s":15120,"e":15440},{"s":15493,"e":15920},{"s":15984,"e":16240},{"s":16300,"e":16720},{"s":16773,"e":17360},{"s":17520,"e":18000},{"s":18060,"e":18240},{"s":18267,"e":18320},{"s":18400,"e":18560},{"s":18613,"e":18880},{"s":18920,"e":19360},{"s":19420,"e":19840},{"s":19893,"e":20480},{"s":20613,"e":21200},{"s":21240,"e":22200},{"s":22310,"e":22640},{"s":22693,"e":23120},{"s":23160,"e":23200},{"s":23248,"e":23760},{"s":23840,"e":24320},{"s":24453,"e":24720},{"s":24760,"e":25120},{"s":25173,"e":25680},{"s":25720,"e":25760},{"s":25813,"e":27120},{"s":27173,"e":27280},{"s":27320,"e":27600},{"s":27680,"e":27840},{"s":27900,"e":28640},{"s":28940,"e":30160},{"s":30213,"e":30320},{"s":30360,"e":31320},{"s":31493,"e":32000},{"s":32053,"e":32160},{"s":32200,"e":32640},{"s":32688,"e":33360},{"s":33493,"e":34040},{"s":340